#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:1
msgid "Sync, Import, Export and Rollback"
msgstr "同步、 导入、 导出和回滚"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:4
#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:4
#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:4
#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:4
#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:4
#: ../../05_node-guide/11_troubleshooting.md:4
msgid "Verified against node-scala v1.8.0."
msgstr "对节点-斯卡拉v1.8.0."

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:7
msgid "Initial sync"
msgstr "初始同步"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:9
msgid "A new node downloads and validates the whole chain from its peers. This takes hours to days depending on hardware and network. Track progress with:"
msgstr "一个新的节点下载并验证整个链条从同等端.这需要几个小时到几天的时间,这取决于硬件和网络。跟踪进度如下:"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:16
msgid "The node is fully synced when `stateHeight` equals `blockchainHeight` in `/node/status` and `/blocks/height` is within a few blocks of a public peer's height. If a node stalls after syncing, restart it and check the [logs](09_logging) for fork or invalid-block messages."
msgstr "`stateHeight` 等于 `/node/status` 中 `blockchainHeight`,而 `/blocks/height` 在公共对等方高度的几块内时,节点完全同步.如果一个节点在同步后停顿, 请重新启动并检查 [日志](09_logging) 叉或无效块消息 。"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:18
msgid "Exporting blocks"
msgstr "导出块"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:20
msgid "The node ships an exporter that writes the blocks (and optionally state snapshots) of a stopped node to files:"
msgstr "节点会将一个被停止的节点的块(以及可选的状态快照)写入文件的出口国:"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-c`, `--config`"
msgstr "`-c`, `--config`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Node config file"
msgstr "节点配置文件"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-o`, `--output-prefix`"
msgstr "`-o`, `--output-prefix`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Blocks output file name prefix"
msgstr "块输出文件名前缀"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-s`, `--snapshot-output-prefix`"
msgstr "`-s`, `--snapshot-output-prefix`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Snapshots output file name prefix"
msgstr "抓图输出文件名前缀"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-h`, `--height`"
msgstr "`-h`, `--height`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Export up to this height (must be > 0)"
msgstr "导出至此高度( 必须是 > 0)"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:29
msgid "Importing blocks"
msgstr "导入块"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:31
msgid "The importer loads blocks from a file (or URL, or stdin with `-`) into an empty or partially synced database, which is much faster than downloading from peers:"
msgstr "进口商将文件(或URL,或用 `-` 的 stdin)的块加载到一个空或部分同步的数据库,比从同位素下载要快得多:"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-i`, `--input-file`"
msgstr "`-i`, `--input-file`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Blockchain data file — **required**"
msgstr "块链数据文件 — **所需数额**"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-s`, `--snapshots-file`"
msgstr "`-s`, `--snapshots-file`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Snapshots data file"
msgstr "抓图数据文件"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Import up to this height (must be > 0)"
msgstr "导入到此高度( 必须是 > 0)"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-n`, `--no-verify`"
msgstr "`-n`, `--no-verify`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Skip signature verification — only for files you trust"
msgstr "跳过签名验证—— 只针对您信任的文件"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "`-q`, `--max-queue-size`"
msgstr "`-q`, `--max-queue-size`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:3
msgid "Size of the block queue (must be > 0)"
msgstr "块队列大小( 必须 > 0)"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:42
msgid "Import stops with an error if a block is not a child of the last stored block, so always import into a node that is stopped and whose database matches the file's starting point."
msgstr "如果一个块不是最后一个存储块的子项,则导入时会出现出错,所以总是会导入一个被停止的节点,并且其数据库与文件的起点相匹配."

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:44
msgid "Rolling back"
msgstr "滚回原地"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:46
msgid "Rollback removes the most recent blocks. It is limited by `dcc.db.max-rollback-depth` (2000 blocks by default) and requires the API key:"
msgstr "倒转去掉最近的块 。它受 `dcc.db.max-rollback-depth` (默认情况下为2000个块)的限制,需要API密钥:"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:55
msgid "With `returnTransactionsToUtx` set to `true`, transactions from the removed blocks go back to the unconfirmed pool. A successful call returns the `BlockId` of the new tip."
msgstr "`returnTransactionsToUtx` 设定为 `true`,从被移除的块进行的交易会回到未经证实的池.一个成功的呼叫返回了新提示的 `BlockId` 。"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:57
msgid "Full re-sync"
msgstr "完全重同步"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:59
msgid "If the database is corrupted or you need to go deeper than the rollback depth, delete the data volume and let the node re-sync from genesis:"
msgstr "如果数据库被损坏或需要比回滚深度更深,则删除数据卷并让节点从起源中重新同步:"

#: ../../05_node-guide/06_sync-and-rollback.md:62
msgid "This destroys all local chain state. Never stop a node with `docker kill` or `SIGKILL` — an unclean shutdown can corrupt the database. Use `docker stop --time 60`."
msgstr "这摧毁了所有本地的连锁状态.永不停止带有 `docker kill` 或 `SIGKILL` 的节点——不干净的关闭会腐蚀数据库.使用 `docker stop --time 60`. (中文(简体) )."

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:1
msgid "Upgrade a Node"
msgstr "升级节点"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:7
msgid "Upgrading replaces the software, not the data: keep the data volume and configuration."
msgstr "升级取代了软件,而不是数据:保留数据量和配置."

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:9 ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:7
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "插头"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:11
msgid "Record the current height: `curl -s http://localhost:6869/blocks/height`"
msgstr "记录当前高度: `curl -s http://localhost:6869/blocks/height`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:12
msgid "Pull the new image, and note its digest so you can pin it:"
msgstr "拉出新图像,注意它的文摘,这样你就可以把它接上:"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:19
msgid "Stop the node gracefully. The image uses `STOPSIGNAL SIGINT` to trigger a clean JVM shutdown; give it time to flush and close the database:"
msgstr "宽宏大量地停止节点。图像使用 `STOPSIGNAL SIGINT` 触发干净的 JVM 关闭; 给它时间冲出并关闭数据库 :"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:25
msgid "Start a new container with the same volume, environment and ports as before (see [Run a Node with Docker](04_install-docker))."
msgstr "启动一个与以前相同的容量、环境和港口的新容器(见 [与 Docker 运行节点](04_install-docker))。"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:26
msgid "Confirm the height continues from where it stopped."
msgstr "确认高度从它停止的地方继续。"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:28
msgid "Reverting an upgrade"
msgstr "恢复升级"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:30
msgid "If the new version fails to start, stop it and start the previous image using its pinned `sha-<commit>` tag against the same volume. Only if the state itself is corrupted should you fall back to a [full re-sync](06_sync-and-rollback)."
msgstr "如果新版本未能启动,请停止,并使用被封住的 `sha-<commit>` 标记来启动上个图像,以对抗同音量.只有当国家本身被破坏时,你才会回到 [完全重同步](06_sync-and-rollback)."

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:32
msgid "From a JAR"
msgstr "从一个JAR"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:34
msgid "Stop the process with a normal `SIGINT`/`SIGTERM` (not `kill -9`), replace the JAR with the new release, and start it again with the same configuration file."
msgstr "用普通的 `SIGINT`/`SIGTERM` (不是 `kill -9`)来停止进程,用新的放出来取代JAR,再用相同的配置文件重新开始."

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:36
msgid "Network upgrades"
msgstr "网络升级"

#: ../../05_node-guide/07_upgrade.md:38
msgid "New protocol behaviour is switched on by [feature activation](10_features-and-activation), not by upgrading alone. A node that does not support an activated feature stops following the chain, so upgrade before an announced activation height."
msgstr "新的协议行为由 [特性激活](10_features-and-activation) 开启,而不是单靠升级.不支持被激活特性的节点会停止跟随链条,因此在宣布被激活高度前升级."

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:1
msgid "Node Wallet and Block Generation"
msgstr "节点钱包和块生成"

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:7
msgid "The node wallet"
msgstr "节点钱包"

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:9
msgid "A node keeps an encrypted wallet file at `dcc.wallet.file` (default `<directory>/wallet/wallet.dat`). It holds the accounts the node may sign for — most importantly the account that generates blocks."
msgstr "一个节点在 `dcc.wallet.file` 保存一个加密的钱包文件(默认为 `<directory>/wallet/wallet.dat`).它持有节点可能签名的账户——最重要的是生成块的账户."

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:11
msgid "The wallet stores a **base seed**, from which account keys are derived. It is not an account seed itself. If `dcc.wallet.seed` is not set, the node generates a new one on first start. To use an existing seed, set `dcc.wallet.seed` (Base58) and `dcc.wallet.password`, or pass `DCC_WALLET_SEED` and `DCC_WALLET_PASSWORD` to the Docker image."
msgstr "钱包存储一个 **基础种子**,从中可以得出账户密钥.它本身不是一个账户种子。如果 `dcc.wallet.seed` 未设置, 节点会在第一次启动时生成一个新的节点.要使用已存在的种子,请设置 `dcc.wallet.seed` (Base58)和 `dcc.wallet.password`,或将 `DCC_WALLET_SEED` 和 `DCC_WALLET_PASSWORD` 传递给多克图像."

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:14
msgid "Whoever holds the seed controls the funds. Keep secrets in a `chmod 600` `.env` file or a secrets manager, never in shell history or a committed file."
msgstr "持有种子的人控制着资金.在 `chmod 600` `.env` 文件中保存机密或秘密管理器,在 shell 历史或已承诺的文件中永远不要."

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:17
msgid "Wallet endpoints"
msgstr "钱包端点"

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:19
msgid "These require the [API key](05_configuration):"
msgstr "这需要 [API 密钥](05_configuration) :"

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:27
msgid "Generating blocks"
msgstr "生成块"

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:29
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A node produces blocks when a wallet account meets the generating-balance requirement under {ref}`Leased Proof of Stake <02_decentralchain/05_node:Leased Proof of Stake>` — its own DCC plus DCC leased to it. To grow a generating balance, other accounts can lease to the node's address."
msgstr "一个节点当钱包账户满足 {ref}`租借证据 <02_decentralchain/05_node:Leased Proof of Stake>` 的生成-平衡要求时产生块——它自己的DCC外加租给它的DCC.为了形成一个生成平衡,其他账户可以租入节点的地址."

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:31
msgid "Check what the miner sees with the privileged `/debug/minerInfo` endpoint, which lists each generating account and its mining balance."
msgstr "检查矿工看到什么 特权 `/debug/minerInfo` 端点, 它列出每个生成账户 及其开采平衡。"

#: ../../05_node-guide/08_wallet-and-generating.md:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid "For reward economics and the block-reward vote, see the {ref}`Node <02_decentralchain/05_node:Node>` article."
msgstr "关于奖励经济学和\"块赏\"的投票,参见\"{ref}`节点 <02_decentralchain/05_node:Node>`\"一文."

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:1
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志"

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:9
msgid "The image writes two streams:"
msgstr "图片写作有两道溪流:"

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:11
msgid "**Console** — at the level in `DCC_LOG_LEVEL` (default `INFO`). Read it with `docker logs`."
msgstr "**控制台** — 在 `DCC_LOG_LEVEL` 中的关卡(默认为 `INFO`).与 `docker logs` 读取."

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:12
msgid "**Files** — under `/var/log/dcc` (volume), written at `TRACE` level by the entrypoint."
msgstr "**文件**——在 `/var/log/dcc` (音量)下,由出入口以 `TRACE` 级写出."

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:19
msgid "Levels, from quietest to noisiest: `OFF`, `ERROR`, `WARN`, `INFO`, `DEBUG`, `TRACE`. Use `INFO` in production; `DEBUG` helps with sync and peer issues but is very verbose."
msgstr "等分,从最安静到有声:`OFF`, `ERROR`, `WARN`, `INFO`, `DEBUG`, `TRACE`.生产时使用 `INFO`; `DEBUG` 帮助同步和对等问题,但非常动词."

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:21
msgid "Custom logback configuration"
msgstr "自定义日志后置配置"

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:23
msgid "Logging is configured with [Logback](https://logback.qos.ch/). Point the JVM at your own file through `JAVA_OPTS`:"
msgstr "日志配置为 [日志](https://logback.qos.ch/).通过 `JAVA_OPTS` 将 JVM 指向自己的文件 :"

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:29
msgid "For a JAR install, pass the same `-Dlogback.configurationFile=...` system property to `java`."
msgstr "对于JAR安装,将相同的 `-Dlogback.configurationFile=...` 系统属性传递到 `java`."

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:31
msgid "Logs worth watching"
msgstr "值得观看的日志"

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:33
msgid "`Fork` and `InvalidBlock` messages — the node is on a different chain or received a bad block."
msgstr "`Fork` 和 `InvalidBlock` 消息——节点处于不同的链条上或收到坏块."

#: ../../05_node-guide/09_logging.md:34
msgid "Out-of-memory exits — the entrypoint starts the JVM with `ExitOnOutOfMemoryError`, so raise `DCC_HEAP_SIZE`."
msgstr "出站出站口——入站口以 `ExitOnOutOfMemoryError` 起站口JVM起站口,故起站口为 `DCC_HEAP_SIZE`."

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:1
msgid "Features and Activation"
msgstr "特征和活性"

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:7
msgid "Protocol changes ship as numbered **blockchain features**. A feature is not active just because a node supports it: it must be activated on the network, either by a generator vote or because the network defaults pre-activate it."
msgstr "协议更改船号为 **块链特性**.一个特性不活动仅仅是因为一个节点支持它:它必须在网络上被激活,要么通过生成器投票,要么是因为网络默认会预先激活."

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:9
msgid "How activation works"
msgstr "如何激活工作"

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:11
msgid "Generators signal support for features they implement in the blocks they produce."
msgstr "发电机信号支持它们在其产生的区块中执行的特性。"

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:12
msgid "At the end of each voting period, a feature that reached the voting threshold is scheduled for activation."
msgstr "在每个投票期结束时,一个达到投票门槛的功能被安排启动."

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:13
msgid "After activation, the new rules apply to every node."
msgstr "激活后,新规则适用于每个节点."

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:15
msgid "Inspect the current state at any time:"
msgstr "随时检查当前状态 :"

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:21
msgid "The response includes `height`, `votingInterval`, `votingThreshold`, `nextCheck` and a `features` list with each feature's status."
msgstr "反应包括 `height`, `votingInterval`, `votingThreshold`, `nextCheck` 以及一个每个特性状态的 `features` 列表."

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:23
msgid "Unsupported features"
msgstr "不支持的特性"

#: ../../05_node-guide/10_features-and-activation.md:25
msgid "By default `dcc.features.auto-shutdown-on-unsupported-feature = yes`: if the network activates a feature your node does not know, the node shuts down rather than follow a chain it cannot validate. The fix is to [upgrade](07_upgrade). Generators can list the features they vote for in `dcc.features.supported`."
