#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:18
msgid "Getting the Node"
msgstr "获取节点"

#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:20
msgid "The node implementation lives at [Decentral-America/node-scala](https://github.com/Decentral-America/node-scala), forked from Dcc 1.6.x. [Docker](04_install-docker) is the simplest way to run it; to install directly, see [Linux](12_install-linux), [macOS](13_install-macos) or [Windows](14_install-windows). All are written in Scala, built with SBT, and packaged from the same source for either network:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:27
msgid "To run a node on the public Testnet, use the Docker image with the configuration file in [Join the Public Testnet](15_join-testnet)."
msgstr "要在公共 Testnet 上运行一个节点,请使用 Docker 图像,其配置文件为 [加入公众 Testnet](15_join-testnet) 。"

#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:31
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Network-specific defaults are defined in [`network-defaults.conf`](https://github.com/Decentral-America/node-scala/blob/main/node/src/main/resources/network-defaults.conf) in the node-scala repository. Pass your own config file (based on the mainnet/testnet template) as the argument to the JAR to override generating-node settings such as the {ref}`block reward vote <02_decentralchain/05_node:Voting>` and wallet seed."
msgstr "网络特定默认在节点-scala寄存器中以 [`network-defaults.conf`](https://github.com/Decentral-America/node-scala/blob/main/node/src/main/resources/network-defaults.conf) 来定义.将您自己的配置文件( 基于主网/ testnet 模板) 传递到 JAR , 作为参数来覆盖生成节点设置, 如 {ref}`块状奖励投票 <02_decentralchain/05_node:Voting>` 和钱包种子 。"

